title: Concepts & Architecture
description: Understanding how Pika works and why it's built the way it is
---

Welcome to the Concepts & Architecture section. This is where you'll build a deep understanding of how Pika works, why we made key design decisions, and how all the pieces fit together.

{% aside title="Understanding vs. Doing" %}
This section focuses on **understanding** and **explanation**. If you're looking for step-by-step instructions to accomplish specific tasks, check out the [Guides](/guides/) section instead.
{% /aside %}

## What You'll Learn

This section is organized to help you build a comprehensive mental model of the Pika platform:

### Platform Overview

Start here to understand what Pika is, why it exists, and when you should use it.

- **[What is Pika?](/concepts/overview/what-is-pika/)** - Core purpose and positioning
- **[Core Philosophy](/concepts/overview/core-philosophy/)** - Design principles and values
- **[When to Use Pika](/concepts/overview/when-to-use/)** - Use cases and decision criteria

### Architecture

Understand the technical architecture and how Pika leverages AWS services.

- **[System Architecture](/concepts/architecture/system/)** - High-level system design
- **[AWS Infrastructure](/concepts/architecture/aws/)** - How Pika uses AWS services
- **[Frontend Architecture](/concepts/architecture/frontend/)** - Chat app and UI architecture
- **[Security Architecture](/concepts/architecture/security/)** - Defense-in-depth security model
- **[Scalability Model](/concepts/architecture/scalability/)** - How Pika scales

