Master the fundamental concepts that drive Pika's design.

- **[Agents as Configuration](/concepts/key-concepts/agents-as-config/)** - Why config-based agents matter
- **[Session Management](/concepts/key-concepts/sessions/)** - How conversations persist
- **[User Memory System](/concepts/key-concepts/user-memory/)** - Personalization across sessions
- **[Model Context Protocol](/concepts/key-concepts/mcp/)** - Tool integration via MCP
- **[Self-Correcting Loop](/concepts/key-concepts/self-correcting/)** - Quality assurance architecture
- **[Authentication & Access](/concepts/key-concepts/auth-access/)** - User types and permissions
- **[Entities & Multi-Tenancy](/concepts/key-concepts/entities/)** - Organizational boundaries

