### Design Rationale

Understand the "why" behind key architectural decisions.

- **[Why AWS?](/concepts/rationale/why-aws/)** - The AWS foundation
- **[Why Serverless?](/concepts/rationale/why-serverless/)** - Serverless architecture benefits
- **[Why Config-Based Agents?](/concepts/rationale/why-config/)** - Configuration over code
